<title>SINGAPORE: Venture shares surge in opening trade.</title>
<headline>Venture shares surge in opening trade.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Venture Manufacturing shares surged Singapore $1.15 to a high of S$8.00 in the opening minutes of trade on Monday.</p>
<p>The rise built on last week's substantial interest in the stock, sparked after the company launched new multi-media software.</p>
<p>Volume was a brisk one million units in the first 10 minutes.</p>
<p>Venture warrants were also active early, rising S$1.15 to 6.80.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703011)</p>
